-- words --
Reading: after a place and a run, a change under goals/G/specs/ alone is no change, so `hyp place G` is refused and the runs used stay 1 of 3 (not: the model edit counts as a changed set).
-- run --
hyp place "$G" 2>&1; echo "place exit $?"; hyp status "$G" | head -1
-- floor: contains --
place exit 1
-- floor: contains --
G  open  runs: 1 of 3 used
